    count: exactly 2, 8-connected monochromatic components of the outline color
    shape: open containers with exactly one row-span cavity (bg cells strictly between leftmost/rightmost outline pixels per row)
    cavity_sizes: two distinct positive integers; one matches source pixel count, the other does not
    pixel_count_per_comp: 3-8
    bbox: 2-3 rows x 1-5 cols, non-overlapping between comps
