  "dst": "missing members of the same arithmetic bbox sequence",
  "transform": "sort stroke bboxes by size, extend the constant bbox delta in both directions, clip each generated side-stroke to the grid, paint those pixels with the foreground color, and paint all other cells grey"
}
</annotation>
